title: "AgentWorkShop: A Node-Native Integration Framework for LLM Multi-Agent Governed Closed-Loop Optimization of Heterogeneous Industrial Production Lines"
message: >-
  If you use this software or benchmark in your work, please cite the
  accompanying IEEE TII manuscript and this repository.
