url: "https://github.com/kingdol666/AgentWorkShop"
abstract: >-
  AgentWorkShop is a configuration-driven integration framework that embeds
  LLM multi-agent teams natively into the supervisory fabric of
  protocol-heterogeneous production lines. A governed write path (recipe-window
  interlock, mode-bound approval, readback-verified write, attributable
  journal), a bounded-autonomy backstop, and the AW-IndustrialBench executable
  benchmark together measure integration adaptability and the safety-overhead
  trade-off of agent-issued actuator writes.
keywords:
  - industrial automation
  - large language models
  - multi-agent systems
  - closed-loop optimization
  - node-native integration
  - human-in-the-loop
